{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo contains a portion of the beginning of Darkbound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/Escapethehospital_ENG.png?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in your hospital room in the middle of the night and you don't know how much time has passed. Find a way out of this nightmare before it\u2019s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/Avoidthedark_ENG.png?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something must be wrong, <strong>being in the dark hurts</strong>. You have to get out before that thing finds you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/corridorwalk.gif?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/Solvepuzzles_ENG.png?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather tools and information to help you solve puzzles and overcome drawbacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/inventario.gif?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707330/extras/Findsurvivors_ENG.png?t=1751621431\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help out and befriend survivors 